+    FSDP2 changes the instance class to FSDPKimiDeltaAttention, whose
+    __module__ is a PyTorch implementation module. The modeling function's
+    globals remain attached to the loaded (possibly remote-code) module.
+    Prefer the pre-CP forward captured by the wrapper; use the MRO only for
+    callers that do not retain it. Never substitute a different KDA backend.
